      "values": {
        "text": {
          "Text": "Fractal Noise stacks Octaves of noise, each finer and fainter than the last; its Value colors a Cosine Gradient. Repeat is on, so the Master Gear walks the noise round a circle and the loop closes. Set Octaves to 1 for plain noise, try each Type, and turn Scale and Gain."
        }
      },
      "width": 380.0
    },
